// 返报只确认原任务已经完成且双方真人在原办理岗位相见；旧钱货与关系变化仍由Task原规则唯一执行。
#include "task_message_report.hpp"
#include <limits>
namespace hanmo::resident {
namespace {
bool contains(const std::vector<StableId>& values,const StableId& value){return std::find(values.begin(),values.end(),value)!=values.end();}
}
Outcome<std::optional<TaskMessageReportPreparation>> prepare_task_message_report(const CommonStore& common,const TaskState& tasks,const TaskCatalog& catalog,const CommonCatalog& shared,const TaskMessageHandoffState& state,const ActionCoreView& action,Integer tick,const DynamicStepInput* phase){
    const auto fail=[](const StableId& code)->Outcome<std::optional<TaskMessageReportPreparation>>{return {false,{},common_failure(code).error};};
    if(state.version!=2&&state.version!=3&&state.version!=4)return fail("TaskMessageReportVersionRequired");Integer observed=common.tick();if(phase){if(phase->from_tick!=common.tick()||phase->from_tick<0||phase->from_tick==std::numeric_limits<Integer>::max()||phase->to_tick!=phase->from_tick+1)return fail("TaskMessageHandoffPhaseMismatch");observed=phase->to_tick;}if(tick!=observed)return fail("TaskMessageHandoffTickMismatch");
    const auto* params=tasks.actions.find(action.id);const auto* task=params?tasks.tasks.find(params->task_id):nullptr;const auto* definition=task?catalog.offers.find(task->offer_id):nullptr;const auto* live=common.action(action.id);
    if(!task||task->contract_id||!definition||definition->template_id!="message"||!live||live->kind!="report_offer"||action.kind!=live->kind||action.actor_id!=live->actor_id||task->assignee!=action.actor_id||params->offer_id!=definition->id||params->context.role_id!=definition->report_role||task->status!="ready"||!task->objective_completed_tick||!task->settlement_id.empty()||(definition->issuer.kind==Owner::Kind::actor&&params->context.provider_actor_id!=definition->issuer.id))return fail("InvalidTaskMessageReportAction");
    const auto* carrier=common.actor(task->assignee);const auto* listener=common.actor(params->context.provider_actor_id);const auto* role=shared.roles.find(params->context.role_id);const auto* assigned=common.state().roles.find(params->context.role_id);
    if(!carrier||!listener||carrier->id==listener->id||!carrier->alive||!listener->alive||!carrier->available||!listener->available||carrier->action_id!=action.id||listener->action_id!=action.id||!contains(live->participants,carrier->id)||!contains(live->participants,listener->id)||!role||!assigned||!assigned->enabled||assigned->actor_id!=listener->id||role->place_id!=params->context.place_id||!contains(role->services,"report_offer"))return fail("InvalidTaskMessageReportParticipants");
    auto from=common.resolved_location(carrier->id),to=common.resolved_location(listener->id);const auto* a=from.ok?std::get_if<SettlementLocation>(&from.value):nullptr;const auto* b=to.ok?std::get_if<SettlementLocation>(&to.value):nullptr;if(!a||!b||a->place_id!=params->context.place_id||b->place_id!=a->place_id||a->settlement_id!=b->settlement_id)return fail("TaskMessageReportNotPresent");
    const TaskMessageHandoff* delivered=nullptr;for(const auto& row:state.receipts.rows())if(row.second.task_id==task->id){if(delivered)return fail("DuplicateTaskMessageHandoff");delivered=&row.second;}if(!delivered)return fail("MissingTaskMessageHandoff");auto known=read_known_task_message_handoff(common,tasks,catalog,shared,state,carrier->id,delivered->fact_id);if(!known.ok)return {false,{},known.error};if(!known.value)return fail("UnknownTaskMessageHandoff");
    for(const auto& row:state.reports.rows())if(row.second.task_id==task->id||row.second.source_action_id==action.id)return fail("DuplicateTaskMessageReport");
    // 公约换任者没有通用历史Role读口；仅原不可变目录指派可作新知情来源，不借今日职务补历史。
    if(definition->issuer.kind==Owner::Kind::organization&&listener->id!=role->initial_actor)return {true,std::nullopt,{}};
    TaskMessageReportPreparation out;auto& receipt=out.receipt;receipt.task_id=task->id;receipt.handoff_fact_id=delivered->fact_id;receipt.source_action_id=action.id;receipt.carrier_actor_id=carrier->id;receipt.report_actor_id=listener->id;receipt.place_id=a->place_id;receipt.role_id=role->id;receipt.tick=tick;return {true,std::move(out),{}};
}
Status record_task_message_report_after_settlement(CommonStore& common,const TaskState& tasks,TaskMessageHandoffState& state,const TaskMessageReportPreparation& prepared){
    const auto& report=prepared.receipt;const auto* task=tasks.tasks.find(report.task_id);if((state.version!=2&&state.version!=3&&state.version!=4)||!report.fact_id.empty()||!report.settlement_id.empty()||!task||task->status!="success"||task->assignee!=report.carrier_actor_id||!task->reported_tick||*task->reported_tick!=report.tick||task->settlement_id.empty()||!state.receipts.find(report.handoff_fact_id))return common_failure("TaskMessageReportSettlementRequired");
    for(const auto& row:state.reports.rows())if(row.second.task_id==report.task_id||row.second.source_action_id==report.source_action_id)return common_failure("DuplicateTaskMessageReport");
    auto id=common.next_id("task_message_report");if(!id.ok)return {false,{},id.error};auto receipt=report;receipt.fact_id=id.value;receipt.settlement_id=task->settlement_id;auto appended=common.append_fact({id.value,task_message_report_kind,"tasks"});if(!appended.ok)return appended;if(!state.reports.insert(id.value,std::move(receipt)))return common_failure("DuplicateTaskMessageReport");state.reports_observed_by[report.carrier_actor_id].push_back(id.value);state.reports_observed_by[report.report_actor_id].push_back(id.value);return common_success();
}
}
